# frontend/dist/ is the one exception: the deployment path (scripts/install.sh|ps1) serves this
# pre-built bundle directly from the backend, so a target machine needs no Node.js/npm/pnpm of
# its own. Rebuild and recommit it (`cd frontend && pnpm build`) whenever frontend source changes.
!/frontend/dist/

